+// draw_ring_segments — the shared annulus quad fan for exactly the given
+// SPAWN_RING_TABLE segments (the geometry single-source — r1 N2/N6 fold:
+// the spawn rings, the solid telegraph rings, and the tie mark's dashed
+// ring all emit from here, so the winding/culling lesson lives in ONE
+// copy). Two triangles per segment; CCW winding in screen space (rlgl
+// culls BACK faces with front = CCW — the CW order culled BOTH the rlsw
+// capture AND the GPU app; the sprite quads render because their winding
+// is CCW). tri 1: p1o, p1i, p2o — tri 2: p2o, p1i, p2i. Deterministic: no
